        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "**QuickSettings** by **EolnMsuk** adds **App Settings** to supported Home Screen app menus. Long-press an app icon to open its page in Settings.\n\nVersion **1.0.2** hides the action for apps without an app-specific Settings page and keeps your other quick actions in their original order.\n\nTurn it on in **Settings > QuickSettings**. The switch applies immediately, and the preference pane includes light and dark artwork, manual update checks, support links, and donation options.\n\nTargets **iOS 15.0+** with separate **RootHide**, **rootless**, and **rootful** packages.",
